msgstr "测试物品已记录。这项委托没有报酬。"

msgid "test.property.book.name"
msgstr "书"

msgid "test.property.book.description"
msgstr "装订成册，等待被阅读、折角或遗忘的东西。"

msgid "test.property.cassette.name"
msgstr "磁带"

msgid "test.property.cassette.description"
msgstr "把声音缠绕在两只轮子之间的物品。"

msgid "test.property.candle.name"
msgstr "蜡烛"

msgid "test.property.candle.description"
msgstr "以缓慢缩短自身来维持一小团光的东西。"

msgid "test.property.clothing.name"
msgstr "衣服"

msgid "test.property.clothing.description"
msgstr "穿在身体外面，也会保存体温与气味的东西。"

msgid "test.item.late_train_timetable.name"
msgstr "末班车时刻表"

msgid "test.item.late_train_timetable.description"
msgstr "末班车之后，纸上的站名仍在移动。折痕里夹着一小段没人走完的夜路。"

msgid "test.item.blank_disc.name"
msgstr "空白光盘"

msgid "test.item.blank_disc.description"
msgstr "表面看起来什么也没有，转起来却会反射陌生房间的灯。它似乎在等待一段尚未发生的声音。"

msgid "test.item.rewound_tape.name"
msgstr "倒带磁带"

msgid "test.item.rewound_tape.description"
msgstr "磁带已经退回最开头，塑料窗里没有留下指纹。按下播放前，它一直记得最后那句没说完的话。"

msgid "test.item.clockwork_moon.name"
msgstr "发条月亮"

msgid "test.item.clockwork_moon.description"
msgstr "拧紧发条，它会沿桌沿缓慢公转。停下时，背面总是朝着你。"

msgid "test.item.cold_pudding.name"
msgstr "冷掉的布丁"

msgid "test.item.cold_pudding.description"
msgstr "焦糖凝成薄薄的琥珀，勺子还留在盘边。冰箱的灯替它守了整整一夜。"

msgid "test.item.paper_cup_water.name"
msgstr "纸杯热水"

msgid "test.item.paper_cup_water.description"
msgstr "纸杯里的热水已经不烫了，杯壁仍有一点雾。它像一次过于简短的休息。"

msgid "test.item.pressed_violet.name"
msgstr "书页里的紫罗兰"

msgid "test.item.pressed_violet.description"
msgstr "花瓣被压得像一块旧墨迹，香气却没有完全离开。合上书时，它仍在两页之间悄悄变色。"

msgid "test.item.birthday_candle.name"
msgstr "熄灭的生日蜡烛"

msgid "test.item.birthday_candle.description"
msgstr "烛芯冒过烟，蜡泪凝在无人许愿的一侧。它记得歌唱，却忘了是谁吹灭它。"

msgid "test.item.inside_out_raincoat.name"
msgstr "反穿的雨衣"

msgid "test.item.inside_out_raincoat.description"
msgstr "口袋都藏在里面，雨水却从内衬向外滴。穿上它的人会觉得自己正从天气里醒来。"

msgid "test.item.unborrowed_atlas.name"
msgstr "无人借阅的地图册"

msgid "test.item.unborrowed_atlas.description"
msgstr "每条道路都通向闭馆后的阅览室。翻到最后一页，会看到自己刚刚走过的路线。"

msgid "test.item.four_am_live.name"
msgstr "凌晨四点现场"

msgid "test.item.four_am_live.description"
msgstr "掌声来自录音棚里并不存在的观众。最后一首结束后，清晨仍拒绝入场。"

msgid "test.item.unsent_message.name"
msgstr "没有寄出的留言"

msgid "test.item.unsent_message.description"
msgstr "按下播放，先听见很长的呼吸。真正的留言藏在倒带时，句尾比句首更接近你。"

msgid "test.item.blinking_satellite.name"
msgstr "会眨眼的卫星"

msgid "test.item.blinking_satellite.description"
msgstr "它绕着卧室唯一的灯泡旋转，每七圈眨一次眼。没有人知道那是在汇报，还是在求救。"

msgid "test.item.counterclockwise_pudding.name"
msgstr "逆时针布丁"

msgid "test.item.counterclockwise_pudding.description"
msgstr "焦糖沿盘沿慢慢退回杯中，勺痕也依次消失。吃到最后一口时，你反而刚刚坐下。"

msgid "test.item.waiting_room_soda.name"
msgstr "候车室汽水"

msgid "test.item.waiting_room_soda.description"
msgstr "气泡模仿远处列车进站的声音。喝完以后，纸杯底部会多出一张不存在的站台票。"

msgid "test.item.echo_violet.name"
msgstr "回声紫罗兰"

msgid "test.item.echo_violet.description"
msgstr "每片花瓣都保存着一次合书的轻响。把它贴近耳边，会听见很久以前的房间。"

msgid "test.item.countdown_candle.name"
msgstr "倒数蜡烛"

msgid "test.item.countdown_candle.description"
msgstr "火焰从十开始沉默地计数。归零时房间不会变暗，只会少掉一件你记得的家具。"

msgid "test.item.bedtime_overcoat.name"
msgstr "睡前大衣"

msgid "test.item.bedtime_overcoat.description"
msgstr "衣领里藏着刚晒过的被单气味，袖口比手臂更早入睡。扣上最后一粒扣子，走廊就会缩短到床边。"

msgid "test.recipe.base.book"
msgstr "任何书"

msgid "test.recipe.base.cd"
msgstr "任何光盘"

msgid "test.recipe.base.cassette"
msgstr "任何磁带"

msgid "test.recipe.base.toy"
msgstr "任何玩具"

msgid "test.recipe.base.food"
msgstr "任何食物"

msgid "test.recipe.base.drink"
msgstr "任何饮料"

msgid "test.recipe.base.flower"
msgstr "任何花"

msgid "test.recipe.base.candle"
msgstr "任何蜡烛"

msgid "test.recipe.base.clothing"
msgstr "任何衣服"

msgid "test.recipe.unborrowed_atlas.name"
msgstr "无人借阅的地图册"
msgid "test.recipe.unborrowed_atlas.process.1"
msgstr "站名从纸上脱落，沿折痕排成新的道路。"
msgid "test.recipe.unborrowed_atlas.process.2"
msgstr "所有没有走完的夜路，在封底重新汇合。"

msgid "test.recipe.four_am_live.name"
msgstr "凌晨四点现场"
msgid "test.recipe.four_am_live.process.1"
msgstr "空白的刻槽开始记住一阵不存在的掌声。"
msgid "test.recipe.four_am_live.process.2"
msgstr "唱针落下时，录音棚外仍是深夜。"

msgid "test.recipe.unsent_message.name"
msgstr "没有寄出的留言"
msgid "test.recipe.unsent_message.process.1"
msgstr "两只轮子向相反方向转动，呼吸被重新缠紧。"
msgid "test.recipe.unsent_message.process.2"
msgstr "句尾先抵达，随后才找到说话的人。"

msgid "test.recipe.blinking_satellite.name"
msgstr "会眨眼的卫星"
msgid "test.recipe.blinking_satellite.process.1"
msgstr "发条把桌面推远，灯泡升成一颗小小恒星。"
msgid "test.recipe.blinking_satellite.process.2"
msgstr "第七圈结束，它第一次朝卧室眨眼。"

msgid "test.recipe.counterclockwise_pudding.name"
msgstr "逆时针布丁"
msgid "test.recipe.counterclockwise_pudding.process.1"
msgstr "焦糖沿盘沿逆流，勺痕一枚枚合拢。"
msgid "test.recipe.counterclockwise_pudding.process.2"
msgstr "最后一口回到杯中，夜宵才刚刚开始。"

msgid "test.recipe.waiting_room_soda.name"
msgstr "候车室汽水"
msgid "test.recipe.waiting_room_soda.process.1"
msgstr "水面升起细小气泡，排列成远去的车灯。"
msgid "test.recipe.waiting_room_soda.process.2"
msgstr "一张潮湿的站台票沉到杯底。"

msgid "test.recipe.echo_violet.name"
msgstr "回声紫罗兰"
msgid "test.recipe.echo_violet.process.1"
msgstr "花瓣吸收合书的声音，颜色逐渐变深。"
msgid "test.recipe.echo_violet.process.2"
msgstr "很久以前的房间，在花蕊里轻轻回应。"

msgid "test.recipe.countdown_candle.name"
msgstr "倒数蜡烛"
msgid "test.recipe.countdown_candle.process.1"
msgstr "熄灭的烛芯重新亮起，从十开始无声计数。"
msgid "test.recipe.countdown_candle.process.2"
msgstr "数字归零，房间里少了一件熟悉的家具。"

msgid "test.recipe.bedtime_overcoat.name"
msgstr "睡前大衣"
msgid "test.recipe.bedtime_overcoat.process.1"
msgstr "雨水从内衬退出，留下被阳光晒过的气味。"
msgid "test.recipe.bedtime_overcoat.process.2"
msgstr "最后一粒扣子扣好，走廊缩短到床边。"

# Daily task selection
msgid "quest.ui.offer.daily.heading"
msgstr "今晚的委托"

msgid "quest.ui.offer.self_care.heading"
msgstr "今晚，我想……"

msgid "quest.ui.offer.reward"
msgstr "报酬：%d 元"

msgid "quest.ui.offer.deep_job.name"
msgstr "深夜兼职"

msgid "quest.ui.offer.deep_job.subtitle"
msgstr "雨林小组 · 临时派活"

msgid "quest.ui.offer.deep_job.body"
msgstr "有人留下了一批没有地址的纸箱。只要在天亮前把标签重新贴好，就没人会追问它们从哪里来。"

msgid "quest.ui.offer.deep_job.reward"
msgstr "立即获得 12 元"

msgid "task.daily.reward.footer"
msgstr "报酬：%d 元"

msgid "task.self_care.footer"
msgstr "我至少要照顾好自己……"

msgid "task.daily.midnight_radio.name"
msgstr "午夜电台"
msgid "task.daily.midnight_radio.subtitle"
msgstr "空白时段"
msgid "task.daily.midnight_radio.body"
msgstr "凌晨两点以后，收音机只剩下一段等待填满的沙沙声。值班员说，有些梦应该先录下来，再决定要不要醒。"
msgid "task.daily.midnight_radio.slot"
msgstr "一盒磁带，且梦游者至少为 2"
msgid "task.daily.midnight_radio.result"
msgstr "磁带在空白时段里转了一整夜。天亮时，电台收到几封来自同一个梦的听众来信。"
msgid "task.daily.midnight_radio.expired"
msgstr "午夜电台最终用沙沙声填满了空白时段。值班员仍保留着你的频率，或许之后还会联络。"

msgid "task.daily.rain_librarian.name"
msgstr "雨中图书管理员"
msgid "task.daily.rain_librarian.subtitle"
msgstr "归还一本没有借出的书"
msgid "task.daily.rain_librarian.body"
msgstr "闭馆后，雨水沿着书架的字母顺序落下。管理员需要一本能压住最下面那张潮湿借书卡的书。"
msgid "task.daily.rain_librarian.slot"
msgstr "任意一本书"
msgid "task.daily.rain_librarian.result"
msgstr "书被放回一个原本不存在的空位。雨水停在窗外，像终于找到了正确的页码。"
msgid "task.daily.rain_librarian.expired"
msgstr "那张潮湿的借书卡被雨水带走了。管理员没有等到书，但下次闭馆时仍可能留下灯。"

msgid "task.daily.moth_rehearsal.name"
msgstr "飞蛾排练"
msgid "task.daily.moth_rehearsal.subtitle"
msgstr "灯下的第一支曲子"
msgid "task.daily.moth_rehearsal.body"
msgstr "橱窗里的飞蛾每夜都会排练，却总在前奏结束前撞上灯罩。它们想找一段足够清醒的节拍。"
msgid "task.daily.moth_rehearsal.slot"
msgstr "一张光盘，且夜行者至少为 2"
msgid "task.daily.moth_rehearsal.result"
msgstr "唱片转动后，飞蛾第一次整齐地绕开灯罩。它们把掌声留在玻璃上，像一层细小的霜。"
msgid "task.daily.moth_rehearsal.expired"
msgstr "飞蛾又一次在前奏里散开。领舞者收起翅膀，准备等下一盏灯亮起。"

msgid "task.daily.paper_crown.name"
msgstr "纸王冠"
msgid "task.daily.paper_crown.subtitle"
msgstr "给没有名字的继承人"
msgid "task.daily.paper_crown.body"
msgstr "商场关门后，有个孩子在自动扶梯顶端举行加冕礼。王冠不必昂贵，但要懂得怀念或做梦。"
msgid "task.daily.paper_crown.slot"
msgstr "任意玩具，且带有悼念者或梦游者"
msgid "task.daily.paper_crown.result"
msgstr "玩具被郑重放在纸王冠旁。孩子宣布今晚的王国不再需要名字。"
msgid "task.daily.paper_crown.expired"
msgstr "自动扶梯顶端的加冕礼结束了，纸王冠被风吹进黑暗。那个孩子或许还会建立新的王国。"

msgid "task.daily.last_festival.name"
msgstr "节日的尾声"
msgid "task.daily.last_festival.subtitle"
msgstr "空茶几上的最后一盘"
msgid "task.daily.last_festival.body"
msgstr "客厅里的人都已经离开，只有电视还在重播烟花。有人想在节目结束前，再尝一口会让人想起旧事的食物。"
msgid "task.daily.last_festival.slot"
msgstr "一份食物，且悼念者至少为 2"
msgid "task.daily.last_festival.result"
msgstr "最后一口吃完时，电视里的烟花也刚好熄灭。空茶几记住了盘子曾经的重量。"
msgid "task.daily.last_festival.expired"
msgstr "电视自行关掉，节日终于结束。那只空盘子仍留在茶几上，等待另一次团聚。"

msgid "task.daily.rooftop_thermos.name"
msgstr "屋顶热水瓶"
msgid "task.daily.rooftop_thermos.subtitle"
msgstr "给还没下班的人"
msgid "task.daily.rooftop_thermos.body"
msgstr "屋顶值班的人听了一夜空调外机。他不挑口味，只希望手里能有一样东西，比风稍微温柔一点。"
msgid "task.daily.rooftop_thermos.slot"
msgstr "任意饮料"
msgid "task.daily.rooftop_thermos.result"
msgstr "瓶盖打开时，一小团白雾挡住了城市。值班的人喝得很慢，像在延长一次休息。"
msgid "task.daily.rooftop_thermos.expired"
msgstr "屋顶的人交班离开，热水瓶仍是空的。他说下次会多穿一件衣服。"

msgid "task.daily.unopened_apology.name"
msgstr "没有拆开的道歉"
msgid "task.daily.unopened_apology.subtitle"
msgstr "门缝外的花"
msgid "task.daily.unopened_apology.body"
msgstr "有封信在门缝外放了很久，收信人始终没有拆。寄信人想再放下一朵懂得怀念或安歇的花。"
msgid "task.daily.unopened_apology.slot"
msgstr "一朵花，且带有悼念者或倦归者"
msgid "task.daily.unopened_apology.result"
msgstr "花被轻轻放在信旁。门没有打开，但里面传来椅子挪动的声音。"
msgid "task.daily.unopened_apology.expired"
msgstr "门外的信被夜风吹走，寄信人没有等到那朵花。或许下一封信会写得更短一些。"

msgid "task.daily.blackout_vigil.name"
msgstr "停电守夜"
msgid "task.daily.blackout_vigil.subtitle"
msgstr "第十三层的窗"
msgid "task.daily.blackout_vigil.body"
msgstr "第十三层整晚没有电，走廊尽头却有人坚持读完一封信。他需要一束足够清醒的火。"
msgid "task.daily.blackout_vigil.slot"
msgstr "一支蜡烛，且夜行者至少为 3"
msgid "task.daily.blackout_vigil.result"
msgstr "烛光照亮最后一行字。读信的人把窗推开，发现整座城市也正在慢慢复明。"
msgid "task.daily.blackout_vigil.expired"
msgstr "第十三层的信没有读完。天亮后电力恢复，那个人却把最后一页重新折了起来。"

msgid "task.daily.borrowed_coat.name"
msgstr "借来的大衣"
msgid "task.daily.borrowed_coat.subtitle"
msgstr "末班车衣帽钩"
msgid "task.daily.borrowed_coat.body"
msgstr "末班车留下了一件不属于任何乘客的大衣。司机想给它找一件懂得回家的同伴，再一起送去终点站。"
msgid "task.daily.borrowed_coat.slot"
msgstr "一件衣服，且倦归者至少为 2"
msgid "task.daily.borrowed_coat.result"
msgstr "两件衣服并排挂在末班车里。抵达终点时，其中一只口袋里多出了一把家门钥匙。"
msgid "task.daily.borrowed_coat.expired"
msgstr "末班车独自带走了那件大衣。司机说它仍挂在最后一排，等一个记得终点的人。"

msgid "task.daily.window_audience.name"
msgstr "橱窗观众"
msgid "task.daily.window_audience.subtitle"
msgstr "闭店后的独角戏"
msgid "task.daily.window_audience.body"
msgstr "玩具橱窗每天闭店后都会演一场独角戏，但台下没有观众。今晚，演员只想听见一次塑料的掌声。"
msgid "task.daily.window_audience.slot"
msgstr "任意玩具"
msgid "task.daily.window_audience.result"
msgstr "新观众被安排在第一排。幕布落下时，橱窗里响起一阵认真而轻微的掌声。"
msgid "task.daily.window_audience.expired"
msgstr "独角戏照常结束，第一排仍然空着。演员向玻璃外鞠了一躬，准备明晚继续。"

msgid "task.daily.afterimage_album.name"
msgstr "残影唱片"
msgid "task.daily.afterimage_album.subtitle"
msgstr "替忘记的人保存一首歌"
msgid "task.daily.afterimage_album.body"
msgstr "有人记得一场演出的灯光，却忘了那晚播放过什么。他需要一张足够怀旧的光盘，把残影重新唱出来。"
msgid "task.daily.afterimage_album.slot"
msgstr "一张光盘，且悼念者至少为 3"
msgid "task.daily.afterimage_album.result"
msgstr "第一声旋律响起，残影便从墙上回到舞台。那个人终于记起自己曾在最后一排哭过。"
msgid "task.daily.afterimage_album.expired"
msgstr "墙上的灯光残影渐渐褪去。那个人没能想起歌名，只记下了结束的时间。"

msgid "task.daily.dawn_picnic.name"
msgstr "黎明野餐"
msgid "task.daily.dawn_picnic.subtitle"
msgstr "在停车场等太阳"
msgid "task.daily.dawn_picnic.body"
msgstr "几个陌生人约好在停车场看日出。他们需要一份既能让人安歇、又能让人保持清醒的夜宵。"
msgid "task.daily.dawn_picnic.slot"
msgstr "一份食物，且倦归者或夜行者至少为 2"
msgid "task.daily.dawn_picnic.result"
msgstr "食物在车顶被分成几份。太阳升起时，陌生人们已经知道彼此昨晚为什么没有回家。"
msgid "task.daily.dawn_picnic.expired"
msgstr "太阳照常升起，停车场里只剩几个空杯。那场野餐被改约到另一个失眠的清晨。"

# Self-care selection
msgid "task.self_care.read.name"
msgstr "读到困倦"
msgid "task.self_care.read.subtitle"
msgstr "让一页纸陪我待到更晚"
msgid "task.self_care.read.body"
msgstr "今晚的房间太安静了。我想读点会让我保持清醒，也会让我想起旧事的东西。"
msgid "task.self_care.read.slot"
msgstr "一本带有夜行者或悼念者的书"
msgid "task.self_care.read.result"
msgstr "我把书合在胸前。那些没有读完的句子，暂时替我守着夜。"

msgid "task.self_care.listen_cd.name"
msgstr "听完一整张唱片"
msgid "task.self_care.listen_cd.subtitle"
msgstr "不要跳过中间那一首"
msgid "task.self_care.listen_cd.body"
msgstr "我想让房间里有一点有秩序的声音，或者干脆让旋律带我去别处。"
msgid "task.self_care.listen_cd.slot"
msgstr "一张带有夜行者或梦游者的光盘"
msgid "task.self_care.listen_cd.result"
msgstr "唱片转到最后一圈。我没有急着关掉播放器，让空白也响了一会儿。"

msgid "task.self_care.old_dream.name"
msgstr "听一场旧梦"
msgid "task.self_care.old_dream.subtitle"
msgstr "倒带，直到听见自己"
msgid "task.self_care.old_dream.body"
msgstr "某段声音或许能让我想起已经远去的房间，也或许能把我慢慢送回床边。"
msgid "task.self_care.old_dream.slot"
msgstr "一盒带有悼念者或倦归者的磁带"
msgid "task.self_care.old_dream.result"
msgstr "磁带轻响着转完。我听见一场旧梦停在最适合睡去的地方。"

msgid "task.self_care.play.name"
msgstr "玩一会儿"
msgid "task.self_care.play.subtitle"
msgstr "把规则忘掉也没关系"
msgid "task.self_care.play.body"
msgstr "我想让手指忙起来，搭一点东西，拆一点东西，看看它最后愿意变成什么。"
msgid "task.self_care.play.slot"
msgstr "一个带有夜行者或梦游者的玩具"
msgid "task.self_care.play.result"
msgstr "我没有完成任何了不起的作品。但桌面上多了一小块只属于今晚的地方。"

msgid "task.self_care.eat.name"
msgstr "吃点东西"
msgid "task.self_care.eat.subtitle"
msgstr "让胃先相信今晚会结束"
msgid "task.self_care.eat.body"
msgstr "我需要一点能把思绪带远、或者把身体安稳留在这里的食物。"
msgid "task.self_care.eat.slot"
msgstr "一份带有梦游者或倦归者的食物"
msgid "task.self_care.eat.result"
msgstr "盘子慢慢空了。我终于能分清房间的安静和饥饿的安静。"

msgid "task.self_care.drink.name"
msgstr "喝点什么"
msgid "task.self_care.drink.subtitle"
msgstr "给今晚留一只杯子"
msgid "task.self_care.drink.body"
msgstr "我想喝点能让我继续看清夜色，或允许我暂时靠回椅背的东西。"
msgid "task.self_care.drink.slot"
msgstr "一杯带有夜行者或倦归者的饮料"
msgid "task.self_care.drink.result"
msgstr "杯底留下一个浅浅的圆。我用手指沿着它绕了一圈，呼吸也慢下来。"

msgid "task.self_care.flowers.name"
msgstr "整理一束花"
msgid "task.self_care.flowers.subtitle"
msgstr "替房间换一种气味"
msgid "task.self_care.flowers.body"
msgstr "我想把一朵懂得怀念或随想的花放在能看见的地方。"
msgid "task.self_care.flowers.slot"
msgstr "一朵带有悼念者或梦游者的花"
msgid "task.self_care.flowers.result"
msgstr "我剪短花茎，换了清水。房间里终于有一样东西不急着解释自己。"

msgid "task.self_care.candle.name"
msgstr "点一支蜡烛"
msgid "task.self_care.candle.subtitle"
msgstr "只照亮手边这一小块"
msgid "task.self_care.candle.body"
msgstr "我需要一束会让我清醒，也会允许旧事浮上来的火光。"
msgid "task.self_care.candle.slot"
msgstr "一支带有夜行者或悼念者的蜡烛"
msgid "task.self_care.candle.result"
msgstr "烛火把墙推远了一点。我坐在它旁边，直到影子不再催我。"

msgid "task.self_care.change_clothes.name"
msgstr "换下今天的衣服"
msgid "task.self_care.change_clothes.subtitle"
msgstr "让肩膀先回到家"
msgid "task.self_care.change_clothes.body"
msgstr "我想穿点能容纳胡思乱想，也能让我知道今天已经结束的东西。"
msgid "task.self_care.change_clothes.slot"
msgstr "一件带有梦游者或倦归者的衣服"
msgid "task.self_care.change_clothes.result"
msgstr "旧衣服搭在椅背，新衣服贴住皮肤。我终于从今天剩下的形状里退了出来。"
